      "content": "it doesnt feel like i'm \"preparing\" for anything. it just feels like there's nothing left of me. i look at his side of the bed and i just feel this massive pull toward him. like, why am i even still here on this side of it? i feel like a ghost walking around a house that doesnt belong to me anymore.",
