      "content": "i know i should probably talk to someone but i just dont see the point. everything is so pointless. he was the only part of this world that made sense. if i'm just a ghost, then maybe i'm just supposed to follow him. it almost feels like the only thing that would actually make sense is to just... not be here. like, wouldn't it just be more natural for us to be together instead of me just drifting like this?",
